= Drag the points, the slide follows

Drag a blue point: the program computes the length of the curve, and the slide shows it.

<div class="controls">
<p>Length of the curve: <span class="length" data-demo-value="length" data-digits="2"></span></p>
<p>
<button data-demo-set="curve=bezier">B&eacute;zier</button>
<button data-demo-set="curve=spline">Spline</button>
</p>
</div>

